---
description: Keep user documentation in sync when shipping features
globs:
  - src/**/*
  - src-tauri/src/**/*
  - docs/**/*
---

When you add, remove, or change a **user-facing** feature in re-dbviewer:

1. Update [docs/USER_GUIDE.md](docs/USER_GUIDE.md) in the same change when practical.
2. Cover: what the feature does, how to use it, and any permissions or limits.
3. If you add a new top-level doc, link it from [README.md](README.md) and [docs/README.md](docs/README.md).
4. Do not invent unreleased features in the guide — only document what is built.
